(text "TPS613222A: pins 1 SW, 2 GND, 4 OUT; pins 3/5 NC.\nD4 external Schottky shares rectifier current.\nC15/C16: two 22 uF 25 V ceramics.\nTarget: 300 mA usable sensor load plus board logic.\nQualify startup, ripple, thermal rise and cascaded-loop interaction at 5/12/22 V." (at 30 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d2cfb458-0533-55b7-92f8-74e7fe05a7f6"))
(embedded_fonts no))
